    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are proud to present to the market this nicely maintained two-bedroom, two-bathroom first-floor apartment, ideally positioned within the highly regarded Drynam Hall development.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Location\r\n\r\nWolsey House is situated in Drynam Hall, a modern residential development located on the Malahide side of Kinsealy. The property enjoys an excellent location with a wide range of amenities within easy reach. Kettles Park and Drynam Golf Centre are within walking distance, along with local shops, schools and public transport links on Feltrim Road.\r\n\r\nFurther afield, Airside Retail Park, Swords Pavilions Shopping Centre and the extensive amenities of Swords are all easily accessible. Malahide is also just a short distance away, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational amenities, including Malahide Castle & Gardens.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well connected, with Malahide Train Station providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while the Swords Express bus service is within approximately a 10-minute walk. Dublin Airport is also within easy reach, and the nearby M1/M50 motorway network provides excellent connectivity throughout Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe property \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The living area provides direct access to a private balcony overlooking the communal playground and landscaped green areas.\r\n\r\nThere are two generously sized double bedrooms, both featuring built-in wardrobes. The primary bedroom benefits from its own en-suite shower room, while the second bedroom is another spacious double with integrated wardrobes. A main family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThis attractive apartment is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. Early viewing comes highly recommended.\r\n\r\nAnnual service charge: €1,613.15"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway – 2.84m x 3.90m A welcoming entrance hallway featuring wood-effect laminate flooring, integrated storage and access to all principal rooms.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.68m x 6.46m A bright and spacious living area with classic ceiling coving, wood-effect laminate flooring, a feature electric fireplace and direct access to the private balcony. The room flows seamlessly into the open-plan kitchen and dining area.\r\n\r\nDining Area – 2.26m x 2.71m with wood floor covering.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.56m x 2.72m Well-appointed kitchen with tiled flooring, a range of matching wall and floor units, granite worktops, integrated electric oven, four-ring electric hob, extractor hood, and space and plumbing for a washing machine and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom – 3.43m x 3.59m A generous double bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes and access to the en-suite shower room.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite – 1.65m x 1.63m Fully tiled floor with half-height wall tiling, walk-in shower with sliding glass door, WC, wash hand basin with vanity storage and an integrated mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two – 2.68m x 3.59m A spacious double bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom – 1.96m x 2.61m Stylish family bathroom with tiled flooring, half-height wall tiling, bathtub, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit and a large integrated mirror."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Chain free\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained two-bedroom apartment\r\n\r\nTwo bathrooms, including primary bedroom en-suite\r\n\r\nFirst-floor position\r\n\r\nTwo generous double bedrooms\r\n\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes in both bedrooms\r\n\r\nBright open-plan kitchen, living and dining area\r\n\r\nPrivate balcony overlooking landscaped communal green and playground\r\n\r\nExcellent location between Swords and Malahide\r\n\r\nConvenient access to Dublin Airport, M1/M50 and public transport"
      },
      {
